OL,3,GNEWSAHospital still busy as critical
OL,4,Aincident stood down
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has stood down a critical
OL,7,Fincident after 24 hours following
OL,8,F"significant work and effort" across
OL,9,Fits services.
OL,11,FUniversity Hospitals Coventry and
OL,12,FWarwickshire (UHCW) declared a critical
OL,13,Fincident on Wednesday after it said
OL,14,Fthere was an exceptionally high demand
OL,15,Ffor emergency care and significant
OL,16,Fpressure on hospital beds.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
