OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAHospital still busy as critical
OL,4,Aincident stood down
OL,5,
OL,6,FGaby Harris, the Coventry-based
OL,7,Fhospital's chief operating officer,
OL,8,Fsaid the situation had eased after the
OL,9,Fpublic was urged to use the emergency
OL,10,Fcare department for life-threatening
OL,11,Finjuries only.
OL,13,FHowever, she stressed it remained "very
OL,14,Fbusy" and teams were continuing to
OL,15,F"work incredibly hard to make sure
OL,16,Fpatients receive safe and timely care".
